Subject: [PATCH 3/3] docs(linux): connect soak checklist; auth/GL harden

Document exact login/devices/connect/gui soak commands and Secret
Service prereqs. Surface actionable D-Bus/keyring errors on Linux,
default --hardware-decode to false on Linux, and make_current before
egui_glow paint/swap/destroy for multi-window safety. No push.
